{"unit_id":"wangqingdhuo__dsh-opencode-acp#card-zh","repo":"wangqingdhuo/dsh-opencode-acp","commit":"a8bfc707ca19b89d0a7c359e2213d298f338814a","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-opencode-acp 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的 OpenCode ACP 子代理插件：它注册名为 opencode 的 provider，并通过 subagent_opencode 将独立任务交给本机 OpenCode 子进程处理。插件提供 OpenCode 模型选择与目录刷新、模型连通性检查、权限策略和工作目录设置，并保存每次运行的状态、会话 ID、耗时和 token 用量，方便回看委派结果。适合希望在 DSH 对话中调用 OpenCode 独立完成开发任务的用户。需要本机安装并登录 OpenCode；设置与运行记录保存在 DSH_HOME 下。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:32-35","index.js:760-820","index.js:1153-1249","client.js:1608-1625"]}
{"unit_id":"wangqingdhuo__dsh-opencode-acp#card-en","repo":"wangqingdhuo/dsh-opencode-acp","commit":"a8bfc707ca19b89d0a7c359e2213d298f338814a","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-opencode-acp connects OpenCode as a DSH ACP subagent. It delegates standalone tasks to a local OpenCode process. The web settings page configures models, permissions, and working directory, and shows run history and token usage. Requires a locally installed, logged-in OpenCode CLI.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:32-35","index.js:760-820","index.js:1153-1249","client.js:1608-1625"]}
